## Setup

```bash
pnpm install                      # or npm install / yarn / bun
export OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...      # provider env var from src/weft.config.ts
pnpm dev                          # watch mode
pnpm start                        # one-shot
```

To switch providers, edit `src/weft.config.ts` and install the matching SDK
(`pnpm add @anthropic-ai/sdk` for Anthropic, etc.). Weft auto-detects which
provider is configured at runtime.

