## Project layout

```
{{name}}/
├── src/
│   ├── index.ts          # entry — runs the example agent
│   ├── weft.config.ts    # Weft runtime configuration (provider, API key)
│   └── tools/index.ts    # composable helpers (resilient, withProvenance)
├── agents/
│   └── {{agentName}}.yaml   # declarative agent — `Weft generate` compiles it
└── tests/
    └── example.test.ts   # vitest unit tests
```

---

## What's where

- **`src/weft.config.ts`** — registers your AI provider. Edit here to swap
  OpenAI for Anthropic, change the default model, set a base URL, etc.
- **`src/tools/index.ts`** — your project's local helpers. Compose `AgentUnit`
  operators into project-specific patterns here so the rest of your code stays
  readable.
- **`agents/`** — YAML agent definitions. Run `Weft generate` to compile them
  into typed TypeScript wrappers under `src/agents/`.

---

## Scripts

| Command | What it does |
|---|---|
| `pnpm dev` | Run the entry in watch mode via `tsx` |
| `pnpm start` | Run once |
| `pnpm build` | Compile TypeScript to `dist/` |
| `pnpm typecheck` | TypeScript check without emit |
| `pnpm test` | Run vitest once |
| `pnpm test:watch` | Run vitest in watch mode |

