## Next steps

- Replace the example in `src/index.ts` with your real agent.
- Edit `agents/{{agentName}}.yaml`, then run `Weft generate` to add typed wrappers.
- Add more agents in `agents/`; the CLI handles wiring.
- See [github.com/wefthq/weft](https://github.com/wefthq/weft) for the operator
  reference (consensus, debate, dialectic, rehearse, replay, supervised, etc.).

